</div>
<p class="n-lead" style="margin:0;max-width:50ch">Niwot is small enough to see properly in a day and interesting enough to be worth the drive. Here is the order that works: coffee, the historic block, the caboose, lunch on a patio, the trail out to the fields, and dinner before you go home.</p>
