<h2 class="n-h2" id="practical-h" style="margin-top:12px;max-width:20ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Getting here, and when to come</h2>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:14px 0 0;max-width:52ch">Niwot is off the Diagonal Highway between Boulder and Longmont &#8212; about twenty minutes from Boulder, fifteen from Longmont, fifty from Denver and an hour from the airport. Park on or near Second Avenue and walk: the two commercial blocks are fifteen minutes apart and the park and the trail are at their edges.</p>
