<div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:0;max-width:60ch">The directory carries one place to stay in the village itself &#8212; the Niwot Inn &amp; Spa, fourteen rooms in the middle of Old Town &#8212; and Boulder is about twenty minutes away, Longmont about fifteen. If you are thinking about more than a visit, the residents&#8217; page covers what living here actually involves, including the November 2026 vote on whether Niwot should become a town.</p>
